This leaf assembles the scaled Taylor envelope and the rational-power
integral engine into the concrete order-0 and order-2 class-moment producer.
The coefficient and endpoint arithmetic is generated over `ℚ`; the
closed-table checkpoint is kernel-checked by the record-1145 layered
literal grounding (see docs/proofs/
1145_g2_kernel_certificate_preregistration.md): every even layer of the
cached convolution plus the top layer is grounded as an explicit literal
